# Digital Humanities

**Authors:** Anabel Quan‐Haase, Kim Martin

## Abstract
<jats:p>This entry provides a brief overview of the field of the digital humanities. The entry discusses the main tenets of the digital humanities and shows its historical origins. It also discusses key current trends including big data, text analysis, and the development of digital humanities centers. The entry concludes with an examination of future developments in the field of digital humanities, such as information visualization and public digital humanities.</jats:p>

